# 🚀 API Configuration (Optional)
# 
# By default, API URL auto-detects based on:
# - iOS Simulator: http://localhost:3000
# - Android Emulator: http://10.0.2.2:3000
# - Physical Device: Auto-detect from Expo manifest
#
# Only set this if you need custom URL (ngrok, production, etc.)

# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:3000
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://your-ngrok-url.ngrok.io
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://api.yourcompany.com
